cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HN Pulse: Hacker News front-page momentum dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "HN Pulse"
version: "2026-09-10T20:00:43Z"
date-released: "2026-09-10"
url: "https://atheistam.github.io/hn-pulse/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Time-series snapshots of the Hacker News front page, Show HN, Ask HN and the
  monthly hiring thread, captured every three hours. 30 snapshots,
  1369 distinct stories, 5025 story observations
  over 7.0 days. Includes derived momentum measurements (points per hour
  observed, staying power, domain aggregates, front-page turnover).
